/E (MazeX 1.0 brings together the sharpest undergraduate robotics minds to solve one of the most exciting autonomous robot challenges: the Micromouse maze. The mission is simple to state but difficult to master - design, build, and program a compact robot that can explore a maze, learn an efficient route, and reach the goal in the shortest possible time without human control.)
