137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Self-containment: The Micromouse must be completely self-contained, fully autonomous, and must not receive outside assistance during a run.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
138 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Power source: The robot must not use combustion-based or pollutant-emitting power sources. The voltage between any two points of the circuit should not exceed 24 V at any time.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Size: The suggested maximum footprint is 14.5 cm length by 14.5 cm width. There is no restriction on height unless updated by the judging panel.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Weight: The weight of the Micromouse should remain constant during the competition. Battery replacements and approved repairs must not unfairly alter the robot weight or performance.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
